                "eyebrow": "Why This Carving Exists",
                "heading": "You Can't Print Depth.",
                "text": "<p>Pick up a printed flag and you feel a board. Pick up a carved one and you feel ridges, grain, and weight — the difference between a picture of a thing and the thing itself.</p><p>Every flag we sell is carved from solid wood and finished by hand in small batches. The waving ripple, the eagle's feathers, the rows of stars — all of it sits in real relief, which is why no two flags are ever exactly alike.</p><p>We check every piece before it ships. If yours arrives less than perfect, we replace it free. That's the whole arrangement.</p>",
                "signature_name": "",
                "signature_role": "",
                "stamp_text": "CARVED BY HAND · NO TWO ALIKE"
            }
        },
